  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - As a result of the excessive scale, poor design and projection beyond the rear elevation of neighbouring properties, the development would be a bulky, incongruous and wholly disproportionate form of development that would significantly harm the appearance of the house and is out of character, to the detriment of the wider area, and harms the living conditions of the neighbours at no.44 and no.48 West Hampton Road West due to an increased sense of enclosure and undue loss of outlook. The proposal therefore fails to comply with adopted Local Plan Policies CC1 (Context and Character), CC2 (Urban Design and Architecture), SC7 (Residential Extensions and Alterations) and Part A5 Residential Extension Guidelines of the adopted Hounslow Character, Sustainability and Design Codes SPD"
